  "datasheet": "https://documentation.espressif.com/esp32-s3_datasheet_en.pdf",
  "verified": true,
  "summary": "Espressif entry-level ESP32-S3 board (v1.1) with an ESP32-S3-WROOM-1/1U or WROOM-2 module, USB-to-UART port plus native USB port, and an RGB LED on GPIO38.",
  "warnings": [
    {
      "level": "danger",
      "text": "3.3 V logic only. The GPIOs are not 5 V tolerant; never connect a 5 V signal to them."
    },
    {
      "level": "warn",
      "text": "Strapping pins GPIO0, GPIO3, GPIO45 and GPIO46 are read at reset (boot mode, JTAG source, VDD_SPI voltage, ROM log). External pull-ups/pull-downs on them can stop the board from booting.",
      "pins": [
        "J3-14",
        "J1-13",
        "J3-15",
        "J1-14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "warn",
      "text": "GPIO35, GPIO36 and GPIO37 are used by the octal SPI flash/PSRAM on every variant in the user guide ordering table (WROOM-1-N8R8, WROOM-1U-N8R8, WROOM-2-N32R16V). Do not use them.",
      "pins": [
        "J3-13",
        "J3-12",
        "J3-11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "warn",
      "text": "ADC2 channels (GPIO11-20) cannot be used while Wi-Fi is on. Use ADC1 (GPIO1-10) for analog input with Wi-Fi.",
      "pins": [
        "J1-17",
        "J1-18",
        "J1-19",
        "J1-20",
        "J1-8",
        "J1-9",
        "J1-10",
        "J1-11",
        "J3-20",
        "J3-19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "text": "GPIO19/GPIO20 are the native USB D-/D+ lines of the \"USB\" port; GPIO43/GPIO44 are UART0, wired to the USB-to-UART bridge.",
      "pins": [
        "J3-20",
        "J3-19",
        "J3-2",
        "J3-3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "text": "The RGB LED is on GPIO38 on v1.1 boards and on GPIO48 on the older v1.0 boards. Both versions are on the market.",
      "pins": [
        "J3-10",
        "J3-16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "text": "On the WROOM-2-N32R16V variant (1.8 V VDD_SPI), GPIO47 and GPIO48 work at 1.8 V instead of 3.3 V.",
      "pins": [
        "J3-17",
        "J3-16"
      ]
    }
  ],
